---
description: Do not scan gitignored or large data files (saves tokens)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ignore heavy / generated files

Never Read, Grep, Glob, or list these paths:

- `node_modules/`
- `.next/`
- `data/*.db` and SQLite sidecars
- `package-lock.json`

Honor `.gitignore`. Do not dump `datasets/*.csv` or resume PDFs into chat or model context. Scripts may stream those files; agents should only peek a few header lines if a schema check is required.

Prefer targeted reads under `src/` and `scripts/`.
